Alembic migration tree for Workout Session Tracking.

See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for the full workflow. Short version:

  alembic current                   # show applied revision
  alembic upgrade head              # apply pending migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"   # generate a new revision

The sqlalchemy.url is NOT hardcoded in alembic.ini — it is
injected by migrations/env.py from app.config.get_settings(),
so the same DATABASE_URL env var drives both runtime and
migrations.
